# The image needs only the app and the agent specs; everything else in outputs/ stays out.
*
!04_agents
!05_demo
05_demo/*
!05_demo/app

# Never into an image: local settings, databases, builds and installed packages.
**/.env*
**/.data
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/node_modules
**/.eval-runs
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
